{"event": "token", "client_s": 6.986, "data": {"request_id": "ab9321b41705", "seq": 27, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:02:46.723Z", "t_ms": 6983, "delta": "**Multi"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 6.988, "data": {"request_id": "ab9321b41705", "seq": 28, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:02:46.724Z", "t_ms": 6985, "delta": "agent Debate** and **Mixture-of-Agents (MoA)** combine the"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 7.393, "data": {"request_id": "ab9321b41705", "seq": 29, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:02:47.129Z", "t_ms": 7390, "delta": " outputs of multiple LLMs through distinct interaction architectures, aggregation mechanisms, and coordination workflows:\n\n### Interaction Architecture and Information Flow\n* **Multiagent"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 7.529, "data": {"request_id": "ab9321b41705", "seq": 30, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:02:47.266Z", "t_ms": 7526, "delta": " Debate** uses a multi-round, iterative discussion structure [C1, C20, C22]. Multiple"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 7.665, "data": {"request_id": "ab9321b41705", "seq": 31, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:02:47.402Z", "t_ms": 7662, "delta": " LLM instances individually generate candidate answers, review and critique the responses of all other models, and update their own responses across"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 7.891, "data": {"request_id": "ab9321b41705", "seq": 32, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:02:47.627Z", "t_ms": 7888, "delta": " multiple rounds to reach a consensus [C7, C11, C20]. In some implementations, multiple runs are further"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 7.989, "data": {"request_id": "ab9321b41705", "seq": 33, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:02:47.725Z", "t_ms": 7986, "delta": " combined via majority voting to obtain the final answer [C5].\n* **Mixture-of-Agents (Mo"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 8.206, "data": {"request_id": "ab9321b41705", "seq": 34, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:02:47.943Z", "t_ms": 8203, "delta": "A)** organizes models into a feedforward, layered architecture consisting of $l$ successive stages [C6, C14]."}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 8.424, "data": {"request_id": "ab9321b41705", "seq": 35, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:02:48.161Z", "t_ms": 8422, "delta": " In each layer, a set of LLMs generates outputs, and downstream models take the concatenated responses from the preceding layer ("}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 8.721, "data": {"request_id": "ab9321b41705", "seq": 36, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:02:48.458Z", "t_ms": 8718, "delta": "along with the original query) as input to synthesize new responses [C14]. A single model typically serves as the final aggregator"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 8.915, "data": {"request_id": "ab9321b41705", "seq": 37, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:02:48.651Z", "t_ms": 8912, "delta": " in the last layer [C14].\n\n### Aggregation Mechanism and Agent Roles\n* **Multiagent Debate** relies on peer"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 9.134, "data": {"request_id": "ab9321b41705", "seq": 38, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:02:48.871Z", "t_ms": 9131, "delta": "-to-peer interaction and mutual convergence [C11, C20]. The agents adjust their own reasoning based"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 9.54, "data": {"request_id": "ab9321b41705", "seq": 39, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:02:49.276Z", "t_ms": 9537, "delta": " on other models' critiques, guided by prompts designed to induce consensus or varying degrees of stubbornness, causing their answers to converge"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 9.627, "data": {"request_id": "ab9321b41705", "seq": 40, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:02:49.363Z", "t_ms": 9624, "delta": " toward a shared outcome [C7, C11].\n* **MoA** divides models into explicit functional roles: **propos"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 9.788, "data": {"request_id": "ab9321b41705", "seq": 41, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:02:49.524Z", "t_ms": 9785, "delta": "ers** and **aggregators** [C4]. Proposers generate diverse reference responses and contextual perspectives, while aggregators critically"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 10.153, "data": {"request_id": "ab9321b41705", "seq": 42, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:02:49.890Z", "t_ms": 10150, "delta": " evaluate, synthesize, and refine these inputs into a single response using a structured \"Aggregate-and-Synthesize\" prompt [C4"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 10.291, "data": {"request_id": "ab9321b41705", "seq": 43, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:02:50.027Z", "t_ms": 10288, "delta": ", C14]. Unlike simple reranking baselines that merely select a proposer's output, the aggregator synthesizes and builds"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 10.562, "data": {"request_id": "ab9321b41705", "seq": 44, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:02:50.299Z", "t_ms": 10559, "delta": " upon the provided solutions [C4, C16].\n\n### Convergence vs. Layered Synthesis\n* **Deb"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 10.822, "data": {"request_id": "ab9321b41705", "seq": 45, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:02:50.559Z", "t_ms": 10819, "delta": "ate** focuses on consensus-building over time; agents debate their reasoning until their individual generations converge on a single answer,"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 11.028, "data": {"request_id": "ab9321b41705", "seq": 46, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:02:50.765Z", "t_ms": 11025, "delta": " though models can occasionally converge to an incorrect value [C7, C11, C17].\n* **Mo"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 11.331, "data": {"request_id": "ab9321b41705", "seq": 47, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:02:51.067Z", "t_ms": 11328, "delta": "A** relies on progressive, layer-by-layer refinement [C4, C6, C14]. It"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 11.487, "data": {"request_id": "ab9321b41705", "seq": 48, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:02:51.224Z", "t_ms": 11484, "delta": " leverages the \"collaborativeness\" of language models—the phenomenon where LLMs produce higher-quality responses when given access to outputs from other models"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 11.726, "data": {"request_id": "ab9321b41705", "seq": 49, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:02:51.463Z", "t_ms": 11723, "delta": ", even lower-quality ones [C3, C4]. The final output is decided only once the aggregation reaches the final layer ["}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 11.787, "data": {"request_id": "ab9321b41705", "seq": 50, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:02:51.524Z", "t_ms": 11784, "delta": "C6, C14]."}}
